## File Naming

Frontend and shared application files use **kebab-case** (lowercase with hyphens).
Convex backend modules use **snake_case** (lowercase with underscores) because Convex file-based function names cannot use hyphens.

```
✅ Good
user-profile.tsx
use-auth.ts
format-currency.ts
client-keys.ts
auth.types.ts
convex/utils/date_time.ts

❌ Bad
UserProfile.tsx
useAuth.ts
formatCurrency.ts
ClientKeys.ts
convex/utils/date-time.ts
```

### File naming patterns by type:

| Type         | Pattern              | Example           |
| ------------ | -------------------- | ----------------- |
| Components   | `component-name.tsx` | `client-card.tsx` |
| Hooks        | `use-hook-name.ts`   | `use-debounce.ts` |
| Utilities    | `utility-name.ts`    | `format-date.ts`  |
| Convex modules | `module_name.ts`   | `date_time.ts`    |
| Types        | `feature.types.ts`   | `client.types.ts` |
| API services | `feature-api.ts`     | `clients-api.ts`  |
| Query keys   | `feature-keys.ts`    | `client-keys.ts`  |
| Stores       | `feature-store.ts`   | `client-store.ts` |

