## Quick Reference Card

| Concept             | Convention              |
| ------------------- | ----------------------- |
| File names          | Frontend/shared `kebab-case.tsx`; Convex `snake_case.ts` |
| Components          | Regular function        |
| Hooks               | Regular function        |
| Callbacks           | Arrow function          |
| Event handlers      | `handle` prefix         |
| Props callbacks     | `on` prefix             |
| Server state        | Convex hooks            |
| UI state            | Zustand or useState     |
| Navigation          | Expo Router             |
| Lists               | FlashList (not FlatList)|
| Styling             | NativeWind (Tailwind)   |
| Multiple conditions | Object map              |
| Guard clauses       | Early returns           |
| Types for objects   | `interface`             |
| Types for unions    | `type`                  |
| Database types      | `Doc<'tableName'>`      |
| Convex functions    | Always include validators|
